  "description": "Material Design UI controls for .NET MAUI with native rendering. Inspired by MudBlazor — beautiful TextField with floating labels, validation, input masks, type converters, adornments, and three variants (Outlined, Filled, Standard). Supports dark theme, dense mode, and 42+ configurable properties. See the sample app: https://github.com/mistrypragnesh40/Flavor.Maui/tree/main/samples/Flavor.Maui.Sample",
