  "releaseNotes": "v0.1.2 — Fix IsReadOnly not preventing editing on iOS/MacCatalyst/Android. SetIsReadOnly and SetIsDisabled no longer clobber each other during property sync. Added tab bar icons and MacCatalyst main page to sample app.\nv0.1.1 — Bug fixes, renamed to Flavor.Maui namespace.\nv0.1.0 — Initial release with FlavorTextField control featuring 42 properties, 7 events, input masks, type converters, validation, adornments, dense mode, and full dark theme support.",
